hould be around the same as the refresh rate.\n\nI had people check with AMD GPUs and in different OSs the same happened. So it's not a driver issue or OS issue, it seems to happen with everyone.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo need, a blank project is already enough.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115650/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}